\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.1}{\ignorespaces High-level architecture of the proposed framework. The system consists of a modality routing model, specialized disease classifiers, Explainable AI modules, and a Federated Learning infrastructure connecting multiple healthcare institutions.}}{56}{figure.caption.15}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.2}{\ignorespaces Classification tree of the proposed two-level framework. The routing model first determines the image modality before directing the image toward the appropriate disease-specific classifier.}}{58}{figure.caption.16}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.3}{\ignorespaces Architecture of the ResNet50 illustrating the successive stages of the model.}}{63}{figure.caption.17}%
